        "toyota-corolla-cross-2024-2025"
      ],
      "rationale": "The owner-selected policy keeps Senatran's manufacture-year and model-year dimensions separate in catalog identity. When both manufacture-year ranges are explicit and do not overlap, that is a deterministic contradiction even if the model year and configuration otherwise agree."
